    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Diesel Mechs</h2><strong>Mechs, Demolition, Physics</strong>, <br><br>Experience the compelling narrative of Diesel Mechs. As a mech operator stricken with amnesia, you are thrust into a world where memories gradually resurface as playable scenarios. It's a journey through the misty realms of recollection.<br><br>Your task will be to master the control of these mechs to effectively carry out the tasks assigned by V\u00e4tkraft. As you solve tasks in this physics-based and destructible environment, dark secrets will be unearthed.",
